            Figures vary by flavor and label version, so check the tub you actually buy. Price tiers reflect cost per gram of protein at typical retail prices rather than sticker price, because a cheap tub with a small scoop is often not cheap at all. Certification status comes from the brand or certifier at the time of writing; listings change, so confirm the exact product and flavor in the certifier's own database before relying on it.
